.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-SPEEDTEST 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-speedtest , rgospeed
.Nd link throughput smoke test
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm speedtest
.Fl loopback
.Op Ar flags
.Nm reticulum-go Cm speedtest
.Fl l | Fl daemon
.Op Ar flags
.Nm reticulum-go Cm speedtest
.Op Ar flags
.Ar destination_hash
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Measures link throughput in the style of an RNS speedtest.
.Pp
.Fl loopback
runs an in-process pipe test for CI and local smoke checks.
.Fl l
listens as a speedtest server (one client then exit by default).
.Fl daemon
listens persistently (implies
.Fl l
and multi-client mode).
Otherwise connect to a listening server by destination hash.
.Pp
Run with
.Fl h
for the full flag list.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-probe 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-status 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
